//   superFx      · null, or { t, dur, sx } while the effect plays. t counts up in seconds.
//   superT       · seconds of window left (0 when it is over)
//   superCarga   · 0..CFG.superCombos, how charged it is
//   superCd      · seconds until it can start charging again
//   superPronto()· true while it is armed and the next swing will fire it
//   #flash.super · the full-frame wash class, fired by piscarSuper()
// desenharSuper() below is a placeholder screen effect and is meant to be replaced.
// ============================================================

// One player swing's worth of charge. Only the player's own swings count: the neighbours'
