// the world-baked leaf icon (iconeMundo) they briefly used were retired with them.

let mobs: Mob[] = [];
// The three of them were the last figures in the world still written in flat hex, and being
// the biggest saturated shapes on the street they were also the loudest thing standing in
// daylight at midnight. They take the hour like everyone else — but with a FLOOR, the way
// the hero has one, because a monster that goes properly dark is a monster you cannot fight.
// The floor is 0.26 against the hero's 0.34, deliberately: he is the read of the frame and
