// The wand itself: a worn wooden shaft with a bound grip. Drawn as a run of steps in three
// passes so a diagonal reads as one stick instead of a row of loose blocks.
// A bolt of magic leaving the wand. Purely decorative: what gets hit, how far the swing
// reaches and how hard it lands are decided elsewhere and are none of this code's business.
// It is spawned off the attack state that is already there and drawn on top of it.
