  // the top fifth and 0.0% of the three below it, against the RUA panel's 36.7% — and the
  // whole picture reads luma 53.1 against the street's 81.4. What stands in for sky is the
  // CLEARING: the brightest thing in that panel is a warm pale olive at the far end of the
  // trail, [149,150,87], and the picture gets DARKER as it goes up into the leaves.
  // So this ramp runs the opposite way from every other sky here — deep humid teal overhead,
